WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.958
After discussion of akṣara-brahma

2
00:00:32.958 --> 00:00:34.750
in the first verses of the eighth chapter,

3
00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:37.375
in this fourteenth verse, 
Lord Krishna takes our attention

4
00:00:37.375 --> 00:00:39.166
from yoga-mixed devotion

5
00:00:39.166 --> 00:00:41.125
toward pure devotional yoga.

6
00:00:41.125 --> 00:00:43.333
He explains

7
00:00:43.333 --> 00:00:44.708
that through continuous,

8
00:00:44.708 --> 00:00:48.083
concentrated devotion, the seeker

9
00:00:48.083 --> 00:00:50.958
can easily obtain Him.

10
00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:57.625
After describing various practices

11
00:00:57.625 --> 00:01:00.750
in the previous many verses,

12
00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:03.625
Lord Krishna here explains

13
00:01:03.625 --> 00:01:06.750
a simple path to obtain Supreme Soul –

14
00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:09.625
'Through pure devotional yoga,

15
00:01:09.625 --> 00:01:12.125
continuous remembrance.'

16
00:01:12.125 --> 00:01:13.666
He says that the person who,

17
00:01:13.666 --> 00:01:15.958
'ananya-cetāḥ satatam,'

18
00:01:15.958 --> 00:01:19.375
meaning without letting
 the mind wander to other subjects,

19
00:01:19.375 --> 00:01:21.916
'nityaśaḥ' meaning continuously

20
00:01:21.916 --> 00:01:23.791
remembers Him,

21
00:01:23.791 --> 00:01:27.500
easily obtains Him.

22
00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:30.250
Lord Krishna uses the word

23
00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:32.500
'su-labhaḥ' –

24
00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:35.500
which shows that pure devotion

25
00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:37.208
makes Him easily attainable.

26
00:01:37.208 --> 00:01:41.083
This is different from other
 difficult paths like aṣṭāṅga yoga,

27
00:01:41.083 --> 00:01:43.750
which require hard practices

28
00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:48.083
like celibacy, chanting Om, and renunciation.

29
00:01:48.083 --> 00:01:50.250
In the coming verses too, Lord Krishna

30
00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:52.125
will expand this very sentiment

31
00:01:52.125 --> 00:01:53.000
that devotional yoga

32
00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:56.125
is the simplest path to obtain that goal

33
00:01:56.125 --> 00:01:59.625
which yoga-mixed devotion also expects,

34
00:01:59.625 --> 00:02:00.500
meaning union

35
00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:04.375
with the Supreme Puruṣa.
 By focusing the mind only on Him

36
00:02:04.375 --> 00:02:06.333
and abandoning other distractions,

37
00:02:06.333 --> 00:02:10.166
the devotee establishes
 a deep connection with Him

38
00:02:10.166 --> 00:02:10.833
that's beyond

39
00:02:10.833 --> 00:02:15.375
the complexities of other yogic practices.

40
00:02:15.375 --> 00:02:17.458
This point also resolves Arjuna's concern

41
00:02:17.458 --> 00:02:21.416
raised in Chapter Six,

42
00:02:21.416 --> 00:02:23.916
where difficulty of controlling the mind

43
00:02:23.916 --> 00:02:24.958
through yoga

44
00:02:24.958 --> 00:02:28.083
was highlighted.

45
00:02:28.083 --> 00:02:31.333
Here, Krishna assures him

46
00:02:31.333 --> 00:02:33.750
that by practicing devotional yoga,

47
00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:36.375
focusing the mind on Krishna becomes

48
00:02:36.375 --> 00:02:41.208
'su-labhaḥ,' meaning easy and fruitful path.

49
00:02:46.041 --> 00:02:52.916
The soul keeps rotating
 in the cycle of birth and death,

50
00:02:52.916 --> 00:02:57.833
meaning always remains in motion.

51
00:02:57.833 --> 00:03:02.041
This is an infinite journey of the soul

52
00:03:02.041 --> 00:03:06.750
that usually never ends.

53
00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:08.666
In this journey,

54
00:03:08.666 --> 00:03:12.000
the path is as important

55
00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.666
as the destination.

56
00:03:14.666 --> 00:03:16.541
Many people think

57
00:03:16.541 --> 00:03:20.958
they'll practice spirituality

58
00:03:20.958 --> 00:03:23.458
when the time is right,

59
00:03:23.458 --> 00:03:28.541
or when I call them.

60
00:03:28.541 --> 00:03:32.375
But this is like

61
00:03:32.375 --> 00:03:37.041
'digging a well when thirsty!'

62
00:03:37.041 --> 00:03:38.666
In life,

63
00:03:38.666 --> 00:03:42.500
one must keep practicing.

64
00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:45.750
Have you ever noticed?

65
00:03:45.750 --> 00:03:46.958
Just as continuous

66
00:03:46.958 --> 00:03:50.125
exercise gives excellent health,

67
00:03:50.125 --> 00:03:53.291
similarly practice also brings solution

68
00:03:53.291 --> 00:03:57.291
to every challenge of life.

69
00:03:57.291 --> 00:03:59.166
If you just sit without effort,

70
00:03:59.166 --> 00:04:02.208
thinking things will change

71
00:04:02.208 --> 00:04:06.333
on their own,

72
00:04:06.333 --> 00:04:08.416
then making progress

73
00:04:08.416 --> 00:04:10.250
will become very difficult for you.

74
00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:14.458
When you take even small steps,

75
00:04:14.458 --> 00:04:18.250
then you move forward, slowly perhaps,

76
00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:20.291
but forward.

77
00:04:20.291 --> 00:04:22.458
Look –

78
00:04:22.458 --> 00:04:24.125
you cannot deepen any friendship

79
00:04:24.125 --> 00:04:28.041
unless you make effort

80
00:04:28.041 --> 00:04:33.125
to maintain connection with the friend.

81
00:04:33.125 --> 00:04:34.583
Devotion

82
00:04:34.583 --> 00:04:39.000
also works the same way –

83
00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:41.333
by remembering Me,

84
00:04:41.333 --> 00:04:44.458
by focusing on Me,

85
00:04:44.458 --> 00:04:47.125
by giving your time,

86
00:04:47.125 --> 00:04:49.708
and by offering little or more

87
00:04:49.708 --> 00:04:54.958
portion of your heart.

88
00:04:54.958 --> 00:04:56.333
By doing all this,

89
00:04:56.333 --> 00:04:59.541
you draw Me near you.

90
00:04:59.541 --> 00:05:01.208
In return,

91
00:05:01.208 --> 00:05:04.375
I respond

92
00:05:04.375 --> 00:05:09.166
by making the path simple and more fruitful!

93
00:05:09.166 --> 00:05:10.458
Therefore, don't wait

94
00:05:10.458 --> 00:05:13.375
for some special invitation.

95
00:05:13.375 --> 00:05:17.000
Start from wherever you are.

96
00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:20.625
You'll find that the more dedication

97
00:05:20.625 --> 00:05:25.000
you give to your spiritual practice,

98
00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:26.416
the more

99
00:05:26.416 --> 00:05:30.166
accessible I'll become.

100
00:05:35.041 --> 00:05:38.000
Have you ever thought

101
00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:40.041
why spirituality

102
00:05:40.041 --> 00:05:42.500
and family life

103
00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:47.416
don't seem complementary to each other?

104
00:05:47.416 --> 00:05:50.708
In family life, this thinking is prevalent

105
00:05:50.708 --> 00:05:56.166
that spiritual discipline is very difficult and boring.

106
00:05:56.166 --> 00:05:59.250
Many people get stuck in this delusion

107
00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:02.791
and set aside spiritual practice.

108
00:06:02.791 --> 00:06:06.416
They assume it's not for them.

109
00:06:06.416 --> 00:06:08.958
Pay attention –

110
00:06:08.958 --> 00:06:11.166
when you obtain knowledge

111
00:06:11.166 --> 00:06:14.416
from scriptures like the Gita,

112
00:06:14.416 --> 00:06:17.708
then you start understanding
 the nature of the spiritual path.

113
00:06:17.708 --> 00:06:20.416
This nature is reciprocal,

114
00:06:20.416 --> 00:06:25.458
meaning the more you practice it,

115
00:06:25.458 --> 00:06:29.250
the more fruit you receive.

116
00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:31.250
Just as in a family,

117
00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:34.458
every member's contribution is necessary,

118
00:06:34.458 --> 00:06:37.041
similarly spirituality also

119
00:06:37.041 --> 00:06:40.541
isn't a one-sided effort.

120
00:06:40.541 --> 00:06:43.958
This is also a relationship

121
00:06:43.958 --> 00:06:47.875
where I respond to your dedication

122
00:06:47.875 --> 00:06:50.250
with My love.

123
00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:52.500
Think –

124
00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:56.458
when a family eats together,

125
00:06:56.458 --> 00:07:00.125
it doesn't just satisfy physical hunger

126
00:07:00.125 --> 00:07:05.250
but also strengthens spiritual bonds.

127
00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:07.708
Similarly, when you and your family

128
00:07:07.708 --> 00:07:10.875
take small small steps toward Me –

129
00:07:10.875 --> 00:07:12.291
whether through prayer, chanting,

130
00:07:12.291 --> 00:07:15.583
or reading scriptures –

131
00:07:15.583 --> 00:07:19.458
then I also respond by
 making the path more joyful

132
00:07:19.458 --> 00:07:22.750
and satisfying.

133
00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:25.958
The Gita teaches that this
path of spiritual practice

134
00:07:25.958 --> 00:07:30.416
isn't about following strict rules,

135
00:07:30.416 --> 00:07:31.791
rather, 

136
00:07:31.791 --> 00:07:34.083
it's about building a loving relationship

137
00:07:34.083 --> 00:07:36.000
with Me.

138
00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:39.291
The spiritual path shows your family

139
00:07:39.291 --> 00:07:42.500
direction at every turn of life.

140
00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:45.625
Therefore, don't let these 
delusions spread in the world

141
00:07:45.625 --> 00:07:46.541
influence

142
00:07:46.541 --> 00:07:51.958
your family's spiritual environment.

143
00:07:51.958 --> 00:07:55.958
Introduce the Gita's teachings in your home

144
00:07:55.958 --> 00:07:57.333
so everyone can understand

145
00:07:57.333 --> 00:07:59.000
the real nature of

146
00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:01.541
the spiritual journey.

147
00:08:01.541 --> 00:08:03.291
Just as flowers make

148
00:08:03.291 --> 00:08:06.083
the entire environment fragrant,

149
00:08:06.083 --> 00:08:09.041
similarly the fragrance of spiritual knowledge

150
00:08:09.041 --> 00:08:14.416
makes your entire family devotional.

151
00:08:14.416 --> 00:08:17.125
When everyone understands that

152
00:08:17.125 --> 00:08:19.875
this path moves forward!

153
00:08:19.875 --> 00:08:22.583
This path is fruitful!

154
00:08:22.583 --> 00:08:26.125
Then it doesn't seem boring or difficult,

155
00:08:26.125 --> 00:08:29.750
rather it becomes a source of joy

156
00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:32.708
and strength for the entire family.

157
00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:38.583
Look, in the office,

158
00:08:38.583 --> 00:08:39.416
that person

159
00:08:39.416 --> 00:08:43.000
whose dedication is most –

160
00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:48.333
they receive the most respect and cooperation.

161
00:08:48.333 --> 00:08:49.833
This principle

162
00:08:49.833 --> 00:08:53.208
applies equally

163
00:08:53.208 --> 00:08:54.750
in the spiritual world too.

164
00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:59.041
In your professional life or work field,

165
00:08:59.041 --> 00:09:02.250
when you show true dedication

166
00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:03.916
to your work,

167
00:09:03.916 --> 00:09:08.125
then you naturally start receiving help

168
00:09:08.125 --> 00:09:11.375
and support from others.

169
00:09:11.375 --> 00:09:13.708
This is similar to the nature of devotion

170
00:09:13.708 --> 00:09:16.708
I've described.

171
00:09:16.708 --> 00:09:21.541
Just as sandalwood cannot
 hold back its own fragrance,

172
00:09:21.541 --> 00:09:25.541
similarly true dedication spreads

173
00:09:25.541 --> 00:09:30.041
positive energy around itself.

174
00:09:30.041 --> 00:09:33.500
When you focus your efforts with integrity –

175
00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:35.583
whether those efforts are

176
00:09:35.583 --> 00:09:37.708
for your work,

177
00:09:37.708 --> 00:09:41.333
your team, or your goals –

178
00:09:41.333 --> 00:09:44.250
then you create such an encouraging

179
00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:45.958
environment

180
00:09:45.958 --> 00:09:49.208
toward which other people are attracted.

181
00:09:49.208 --> 00:09:50.666
Think –

182
00:09:50.666 --> 00:09:54.166
when in an office an employee

183
00:09:54.166 --> 00:09:57.750
does their work with complete dedication,

184
00:09:57.750 --> 00:10:00.458
then their colleagues and superiors

185
00:10:00.458 --> 00:10:03.625
are naturally attracted toward them.

186
00:10:03.625 --> 00:10:06.416
Their work style, their dedication,

187
00:10:06.416 --> 00:10:10.000
and their firmness inspire everyone.

188
00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:12.041
A dedicated employee

189
00:10:12.041 --> 00:10:14.583
not only receives respect

190
00:10:14.583 --> 00:10:19.375
but also invites cooperation.

191
00:10:19.375 --> 00:10:21.375
Colleagues and leaders

192
00:10:21.375 --> 00:10:22.708
are eager to give more help

193
00:10:22.708 --> 00:10:25.750
to that person

194
00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:28.875
whom they see making continuous effort.

195
00:10:28.875 --> 00:10:32.250
Just as I respond

196
00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:35.125
to My devotees' true efforts,

197
00:10:35.125 --> 00:10:38.375
similarly the workplace environment

198
00:10:38.375 --> 00:10:41.916
definitely responds positively

199
00:10:41.916 --> 00:10:43.583
to your dedication.

200
00:10:43.583 --> 00:10:46.833
You'll find that doors open,

201
00:10:46.833 --> 00:10:48.833
guidance is received,

202
00:10:48.833 --> 00:10:52.583
and crossing obstacles becomes easy.

203
00:10:52.583 --> 00:10:55.416
Therefore, keep making continuous

204
00:10:55.416 --> 00:10:57.125
meaningful effort in your work.

205
00:10:57.125 --> 00:11:00.416
By remaining committed to your work,

206
00:11:00.416 --> 00:11:04.250
everyone starts supporting you from the heart!

207
00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:06.833
Just as sugar, when mixed in milk,

208
00:11:06.833 --> 00:11:10.916
makes it sweet, similarly

209
00:11:10.916 --> 00:11:13.500
the sweetness of your dedication

210
00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:16.916
inspires the workplace environment,

211
00:11:16.916 --> 00:11:22.375
and everyone starts working
 with dedication like yours.
